<!doctype html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>404 — Sahifa topilmadi</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow">
  <style>
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
         font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Noto Sans',sans-serif;
         background:#0c1e2c;color:#e8f3ff}
    .card{background:#0f2434;border:1px solid #1e4e73;border-radius:14px;padding:28px 24px;
          width:min(560px,92%);text-align:center}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px}
    p{margin:8px 0 16px;opacity:.9}
    a.btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;
          border:1px solid #2d7cc5;background:#2d7cc5;color:#fff}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card" role="alert">
    <h1>404 — Sahifa topilmadi</h1>
    <p>Siz qidirgan manzil mavjud emas yoki o‘zgartirilgan.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="https://namoz-vaqti.uz/">Bosh sahifa</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
